      "translationNo": "Oversettelse kommer",
      "commentary": "",
      "audioTalawat": "183353055073.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 74,
      "text": "لَمۡ يَطۡمِثۡهُنَّ اِنۡسٌ قَبۡلَهُمۡ وَلَا جَآنٌّ\u0026zwnj;ۚ\u0026rlm; ",
      "translationNo": "Oversettelse kommer",
